WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.503 --> 00:00:03.253
(robot whirring)

00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:08.575
(bright pop music)

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.613
- [Narrator] Kuri is a
home robot that responds

00:00:10.613 --> 00:00:12.092
to your voice and touch.

00:00:12.092 --> 00:00:14.157
He can play music,
navigate around your house,

00:00:14.157 --> 00:00:16.312
and record video, but most importantly,

00:00:16.312 --> 00:00:18.153
he wants to be your friend.

00:00:18.153 --> 00:00:22.846
- I don't foresee myself becoming
like super close with Kuri

00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:26.429
- I can definitely get
attached to a robot.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.402
Why, I'm not a very
social person, you know,

00:00:30.402 --> 00:00:31.972
like my best friend's are three cats.

00:00:31.972 --> 00:00:32.968
- Alright, I'm ready to meet Kuri.

00:00:32.968 --> 00:00:34.415
- Please, bring it on.

00:00:34.415 --> 00:00:36.440
It's just, look I'm shaking right now.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.609
- Hi, I'm Jen. I work with
the team that developed Kuri

00:00:38.609 --> 00:00:41.007
over in California and he's
an adorable home robot.

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.159
Let's get Kuri in here.

00:00:42.159 --> 00:00:44.409
(laughing)

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:53.160
Let's go play with Kuri.

00:00:55.011 --> 00:00:59.761
- Alright Kuri, welcome to
Buzzfeed. Let's have some fun.

00:01:01.044 --> 00:01:03.788
We're here at my desk and we have Vanessa.

00:01:03.788 --> 00:01:07.788
Vanessa, come meet Kuri.
He's coming. Oh...shit.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:16.330
- So let's go take a walk
around with my little new buddy.

00:01:16.763 --> 00:01:18.681
He follows you around.

00:01:18.681 --> 00:01:19.514
- That's creepy.

00:01:19.514 --> 00:01:20.347
(laughing)

00:01:20.347 --> 00:01:21.502
(gasping)

00:01:21.502 --> 00:01:23.467
- Did you hear that?

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:26.962
(Kuri sneezing)

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:28.832
- I love it so much.

00:01:28.832 --> 00:01:31.661
- He literally has fans right now.

00:01:31.661 --> 00:01:36.292
Are they bothering you? No?
That's totally fine, okay!

00:01:36.292 --> 00:01:38.245
- Alright guys, what do
you think about Kuri?

00:01:38.245 --> 00:01:39.328
- I love him.

00:01:41.099 --> 00:01:43.426
- Okay, he's like the nicest person ever.

00:01:43.426 --> 00:01:45.204
I don't need any of these creatures here.

00:01:45.204 --> 00:01:47.042
What a waste, what a waste of time.

00:01:47.042 --> 00:01:48.639
- Hey Kuri, I know that
you don't speak English

00:01:48.639 --> 00:01:50.591
but tell me a joke.

00:01:50.591 --> 00:01:52.674
(beeps)

00:01:52.674 --> 00:01:57.424
Holy shit, that was funny.
He's laughing at his own joke!

00:01:58.476 --> 00:02:00.812
- Hey Kuri, you wanna go
like try to find a wig?

00:02:00.812 --> 00:02:02.793
I think it's gonna suit you.

00:02:02.793 --> 00:02:06.417
That silence is like...don't
even try, bitch.

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:07.438
(Kuri sneezing)

00:02:07.438 --> 00:02:10.112
Oh I'm so sorry! He's allergic to me.

00:02:10.112 --> 00:02:12.362
(laughing)

00:02:14.381 --> 00:02:16.044
- And for Kuri's last trick,

00:02:16.044 --> 00:02:19.127
hey Kuri, play me your favorite song.

00:02:20.004 --> 00:02:22.671
(robotic music)

00:02:24.017 --> 00:02:26.747
♪ Pancake robot is coming to town ♪

00:02:26.747 --> 00:02:30.337
♪ He's mixing up the batter
and he's laying it down ♪

00:02:30.337 --> 00:02:33.388
♪ Buttermilk, blueberry, chocolate chip ♪

00:02:33.388 --> 00:02:34.282
- What is that song?

00:02:34.282 --> 00:02:35.798
- Pancake robot, ever heart of it?

00:02:35.798 --> 00:02:37.115
- He's getting ready to leave.

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:39.116
This is a sad moment, guys.

00:02:39.116 --> 00:02:41.092
I'm just not sure I'm ready for this

00:02:41.092 --> 00:02:44.446
but you gotta get the strength and do it.

00:02:44.446 --> 00:02:47.961
If there's one thing I
learned it's that he gets

00:02:47.961 --> 00:02:49.622
all the attention, yo, that's messed up.

00:02:49.622 --> 00:02:51.742
It's like walking around
with a prettier friend

00:02:51.742 --> 00:02:54.718
and you like the shit no one looks at.

00:02:54.718 --> 00:02:56.871
- Kuri and I had a really,
really nice day together

00:02:56.871 --> 00:03:01.141
but eventually, he had to
go and it was pretty sad.

00:03:01.141 --> 00:03:05.541
- Really, I did not expect to
have so much fun with a robot.

00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:08.124
- I was super skeptical of Kuri

00:03:09.443 --> 00:03:12.398
and hanging out with a robot all day.

00:03:12.398 --> 00:03:16.515
- It was insane; I felt like
walking with a tiny celebrity.

00:03:16.515 --> 00:03:19.727
- I think Kuri's so
cute; he doesn't really

00:03:19.727 --> 00:03:21.836
do a whole lot of stuff but I like it

00:03:21.836 --> 00:03:24.480
because I think if he knew too much,

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.102
I'd be like super freaked out.

00:03:26.102 --> 00:03:28.317
- I'm not bullshitting you here,

00:03:28.317 --> 00:03:31.329
I think by this time he
and I are best friends.

00:03:31.329 --> 00:03:33.094
- Hey Kuri, I love you.

00:03:33.094 --> 00:03:36.672
- And I'm only waiting for you
to come back so please do so.

00:03:36.672 --> 00:03:38.624
(robot whirring)

00:03:38.624 --> 00:03:41.541
(bright pop music)

